{"articleNo":"126774","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=126774&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대학원]과학기술인력 대상 'Researcher CLE 기술창업교육' 참여자 모집 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.03.27","hit":"2821","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#008299\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">과학기술인력 대상 'Researcher CLE 기술창업교육' </span></strong></font></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#003399\"><strong>대구경북과학기술원에서는 미래창조과학부 지원으로 아래와 같이 교</strong></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#003399\"><strong>육을 </strong></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#003399\"><strong>실시하고자 하오니 관심있는 대학원생들의 많은 참여 바랍니다.</strong></font></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#003399\"><strong></strong></font></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#990085\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- 아&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 래 -</span></strong></font></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#003399\"><strong></strong></font></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; 1. 신청기간 : 2015. 03. 16. (월)&nbsp;~ 04. 10. (금)</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; 2. &nbsp;신청방법 : DGIST CLE 기술창업교육 홈페이지( </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><a href=\"http://cle.dgist.ac.kr/\">http://cle.dgist.ac.kr</a></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">)</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;또는 모바일앱 DGIST CLE 설치하여 교육신청</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;3.<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> 교육대상</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 현재 또는 향후에 보유 기술을 사업화 하고자 하는 연구개발자 및 석·박사 인력</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 기술사업화를 성공시키고자 하는 R&amp;D 지원기관 담당자</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 기술사업화에 관심 있는 대학생 및 일반인</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">단, 대학생 및 일반인은 교육인원이 미달했을 경우에 한하며, 신청 순으로 선발)</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 교육인원 : 40명</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; 5. 교육기간 : 2015. 04. 16. (목) ~ 05. 14. (목)</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;6. 교육장소 </span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;- 대구경북과학기술원</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;-한국전자통신연구원 대경권연구센터</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 한국기계연구원 대구융합기술연구센터</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 한국생산기술연구원 대경지역본부</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">※ 위 기관을 1주씩 순회하며 교육</span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; 7. 문의처 : DGIST&nbsp;기술사업화팀 교육담당자 053)785-1915&nbsp;</p></span><p>&nbsp;&nbsp; </p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2015. 03</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">금오공과대학교 대학원장</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
